[{"id":"cnm_h027_q1","topicId":"cnm_h027","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个对应是从实数集到实数集的函数？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"每个 x 对应 x+1"},{"key":"B","text":"每个正数对应它的两个平方根"},{"key":"C","text":"y²=x"},{"key":"D","text":"每个 x 可以对应任意一个不小于它的数"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"函数要求每个 x 只对应一个 y。两个平方根、y²=x 和「任意一个」都不唯一。","verify":"\"每个 x 对应 x+1\""},{"id":"cnm_h027_q2","topicId":"cnm_h027","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=2x+1，求 f(3)。","answer":"7","explanation":"把 x=3 代入，2×3+1=7。","verify":"2*3+1"},{"id":"cnm_h027_q3","topicId":"cnm_h027","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"g(x)=x²，求 g(−2)。","answer":"4","explanation":"平方后是 4，与 −2 的符号无关。","verify":"(-2)**2"},{"id":"cnm_h027_q4","topicId":"cnm_h027","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"f(x)=x 与 g(t)=t 是否表示同一个函数？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"不是，字母不同"},{"key":"B","text":"不是，一个叫 f 一个叫 g"},{"key":"C","text":"只有值域相同才算同一个"},{"key":"D","text":"是，对应关系相同且定义域都是实数"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"函数由定义域和对应关系决定，自变量用哪个字母不影响。","verify":"\"是，对应关系相同且定义域都是实数\""},{"id":"cnm_h028_q1","topicId":"cnm_h028","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=1/(x−2)。在 1，2，3 这三个数中，有几个在定义域内？","answer":"2","explanation":"分母不能为 0，x=2 除外，1 和 3 可以，共 2 个。","verify":"len([1,3])"},{"id":"cnm_h028_q2","topicId":"cnm_h028","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=√(x−1) 的定义域中，1 到 5 的整数有几个？","answer":"5","explanation":"被开方数大于或等于 0，x≥1。1 到 5 的整数共 5 个。","verify":"len([1,2,3,4,5])"},{"id":"cnm_h028_q3","topicId":"cnm_h028","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"f(x)=1/x 的定义域是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"全体实数"},{"key":"B","text":"全体正数"},{"key":"C","text":"只有 1"},{"key":"D","text":"全体非零实数"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"分母不能为 0，其余实数都可以。","verify":"\"全体非零实数\""},{"id":"cnm_h028_q4","topicId":"cnm_h028","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=√(4−x)+1/(x−1)。x=0 是否在定义域内？在回答 1，不在回答 0。","answer":"1","explanation":"4−0≥0，且 0≠1，两个条件都满足。","verify":"1"},{"id":"cnm_h029_q1","topicId":"cnm_h029","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x+1，x∈{0，1，2}。函数值中的最大值是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"三个函数值是 1、2、3，最大是 3。","verify":"2+1"},{"id":"cnm_h029_q2","topicId":"cnm_h029","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=−x² 的最大值是多少？","answer":"0","explanation":"平方项非负，前面带负号后最大是 0，在 x=0 处取到。","verify":"0"},{"id":"cnm_h029_q3","topicId":"cnm_h029","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"f(x)=x²，x∈{−1，2}。两个函数值的和是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"1+4=5。","verify":"(-1)**2+2**2"},{"id":"cnm_h029_q4","topicId":"cnm_h029","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"y=2^x（x 为实数，底数 2）的值域是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"全体实数"},{"key":"B","text":"全体正实数"},{"key":"C","text":"全体非负实数"},{"key":"D","text":"大于或等于 1 的实数"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"指数函数值恒正，可以任意接近 0 但取不到 0，也可以任意大。","verify":"\"全体正实数\""},{"id":"cnm_h030_q1","topicId":"cnm_h030","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"表格中 x=1 时 y=4，x=2 时 y=7。这两个函数值的差 y(2)−y(1) 是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"列表法直接读数，7−4=3。","verify":"7-4"},{"id":"cnm_h030_q2","topicId":"cnm_h030","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"函数用列表表示：f(1)=2，f(2)=5，f(4)=11。求 f(1)+f(4)。","answer":"13","explanation":"列表法直接读出对应值，f(1)=2，f(4)=11，和是 13。","verify":"2+11"},{"id":"cnm_h030_q3","topicId":"cnm_h030","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"图象经过点 (2，5)。当 x=2 时函数值是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"点的纵坐标就是对应的函数值。","verify":"5"},{"id":"cnm_h030_q4","topicId":"cnm_h030","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"只给出四个对应点的表格，能否确定全体实数上的唯一函数？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"能，表格一旦写出就唯一"},{"key":"B","text":"能，只要点在一条直线上"},{"key":"C","text":"不能"},{"key":"D","text":"只有画成曲线才不能"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"表格只给出已列出的对应。没有声明定义域和全部对应时，不能唯一确定整个函数。","verify":"\"不能\""},{"id":"cnm_h031_q1","topicId":"cnm_h031","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"x<0 时 f(x)=x+1，x≥0 时 f(x)=2x。求 f(−2)。","answer":"-1","explanation":"−2 小于 0，用第一段，−2+1=−1。","verify":"-2+1"},{"id":"cnm_h031_q2","topicId":"cnm_h031","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"x<0 时 f(x)=x+1，x≥0 时 f(x)=2x。求 f(3)。","answer":"6","explanation":"3≥0，用第二段 f(x)=2x，2×3=6。","verify":"2*3"},{"id":"cnm_h031_q3","topicId":"cnm_h031","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"出租车：3 公里及以内 10 元，超出部分每公里 2 元。行驶 5 公里的车费是多少元？","answer":"14","explanation":"超出 2 公里，10+4=14 元。","verify":"10+2*(5-3)"},{"id":"cnm_h031_q4","topicId":"cnm_h031","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"分段函数在分段点处要特别检查什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"分段点可以对应两个值"},{"key":"B","text":"分段点必须没有定义"},{"key":"C","text":"两段解析式必须相同"},{"key":"D","text":"这一点到底用哪一段，以及函数值是否唯一"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"分界点只能属于一段，对应的函数值必须唯一。","verify":"\"这一点到底用哪一段，以及函数值是否唯一\""}]
